===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|Kerntene}}, {{m|gmh|Kerenten}}, from {{inh|de|goh|}}, from {{der|de|la|Carantania}}, possibly from a {{der|de|cel|-}} language, if so, from {{der|de|cel-pro|*karantos|t=ally, friend}}, related to the verb {{m|cel-pro|*kareti|t=to love}}. More at [[w:Carinthia#Name|Carinthia]].

